cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "prerelation (R): the prerelation coefficient in R"
abstract: >-
  A base-R implementation of the prerelation coefficient, the prerelation
  direction coefficient and the pairwise dominance scan, with no
  dependencies outside base R, held in parity with the Python reference
  implementation and the JavaScript implementation through their committed
  golden vectors. Covers the coefficient and the scan; the ceiling
  correction, plausible-value handling and the study runner are not
  included.
type: software
